# Applies to builds whose context is the repo root — i.e. the Go services,
# which build from the root so that shared modules under libs/ are reachable
# (they are `replace` targets outside any single service dir).
#
# The Go images copy only libs/ and their own service dir, but the context is
# uploaded to the builder in full, so exclude the heavy trees no Go build
# reads. The Node/Docusaurus images use their own context under apps/ and
# their own .dockerignore, so nothing here affects them.
#
# Do not exclude build/ — the Dockerfile itself is read from the context.
.git
.github
apps
docs
scripts
**/node_modules
*.md
